        `term` IS "amending provision, of a law"
        `how it is defined` IS `means and includes`
        `applies to` IS "this section"
        `meaning as printed` IS "amending provision, of a law, means a provision of the law that only amends or repeals a law, and includes—"
        `further lines as printed` IS LIST ("(a) any other provision (for example, a schedule) of the law that only identifies the law amended or repealed; and"), ("(b) any other provision (for example, a part heading) of the law that only identifies (or groups) provisions that are amended or repealed.")

