-- The definition of the term in the in-scope sections that define it; the first, if two sections define the same term.
-- NOTHING if no in-scope section defines the term.
GIVEN term IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE `Definition`
`the first definition inside an in-scope section of the term` MEANS `the first definition of` term `the definitions inside the in-scope sections`

GIVEN term IS A STRING, entries IS A LIST OF `Definition`
GIVETH A MAYBE `Definition`
`the first definition of` MEANS
    CONSIDER entries
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING
    WHEN first FOLLOWED BY rest THEN
        IF   first's `term` EQUALS term
        THEN JUST first
        ELSE `the first definition of` term rest
